mooth animations brought by modern technology and the look and feel of retro pixel game design leads to a fresh  contemporary graphic style.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/454330/extras/20bce1161a1e5e7192d120e5ce4ef8c5.avif?t=1728662213\" width=616 height=346 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/454330/extras/f1c27391f52a961ba30ef218e2eaeb2f.webp?t=1728662213\" width=270 height=5 /></span>",
